                "text": "Sepsis is a devastating medical condition claiming hundreds of thousands of American lives each year\n\nThis tragedy is compounded because dying from sepsis can be prevented with early detection and treatment\n\nToday I\u2019m introducing the SEPSIS Act to reduce fatalities and save lives",
