                "text": "This young girl\u2019s life was saved thanks to the groundbreaking research here on Long Island at Cold Spring Harbor Laboratory.\n\nA breakthrough treatment for Spinal Muscular Atrophy was discovered right here that saved her life.\n\nBut that\u2019s exactly the kind of research that\u2019s being decimated by DOGE\u2019s cuts to the National Institutes of Health.\n\nWe are fighting back for patients across the country.",
