                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Donald Trump and DOGE slashed the workforce for the World Trade Center Health Program that supports our 9/11 first responders, survivors, and families.\n\nBecause of these barbaric cuts, our heroes will have to worry about whether they\u00a0can receive\u00a0life-saving treatment or face longer wait times to\u00a0get\u00a0desperately needed care.\n\nSenate Democrats are exposing how\u00a0this is all a front to clear the way for a tax cut for Trump\u2019s billionaire buddies.\n\nAnd I\u2019m fighting to get HHS and RFK Jr. to reverse it.",
