                "text": "Today is #WorldAIDSDay2025.\n\nFor the more than 1.2 million Americans living with HIV, it\u2019s critical that Congress and the federal government do everything possible to combat this disease and expand access to prevention, treatment, and care.\n\nThat\u2019s why the Republican proposal to eliminate the CDC\u2019s HIV prevention budget is so alarming. We must ensure these lifesaving programs remain fully funded\u2014and Democrats in Congress will fight tirelessly to protect them.",
